<!--/Post: 10888-->
<!--Post: 10917--><!--Time: 1110300481-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10917"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 8:48 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->He is probably not sleeping because he is out of his usual bed and routine. I am pretty sure that the jail beds are not Beautyrest mattresses. He also runs the chance of picking up cooties in there as well. You can be assured that he is truly plotting an escape. Of course, with his level of pride, he may never has planned on getting caught. <BR> <BR>I read on another board that his son in law reported that Kerri has had nightmares for years and wakes up screaming that someone is trying to get in and kill her. A former boyfriend stated that it was well known when they were in high school that her father was BTK! They all had web pages that have been removed. However, if you click on cached, you can still get some info.  <BR> <BR>How do things gets this far that people are so removed from reality that they do not act and let something like this go for so many years? When the plane crashed in Houston a couple of months ago over the toll road and pieces fell into a family van as they were driving, the mother made the comment that it was just like the movies. NO!!! The movies depict life for the most part. People have gotten their realities confused. In one of my weapons training videos, the man who started Gunsight stated that when people are present at a place where a robbery/assault are taking place, they do not react because they treat it like watching a movie.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10917-->
<!--Post: 11480--><!--Time: 1110779980-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11480"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 13, 2005 - 9:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TD, <BR> <BR>Very interesting info re: the former boyfriend&#39;s claims that it was well known that Rader was BTK. IMO all LE personnel as well as civil servants should be required to submit DNA samples upon their hiring.  .  .   <BR> <BR>A National DNA database is not far around the corner.  .  .  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
